      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A2 / Guardian 独立应急 nonce lane\nRiskRegistry.addHold(vault, token, false, caseId)\n即使 vault.code.length = 0 也能 HOLD；全资产范围显式 allAssets=true。\nManager.cancelOperation(operationId) 撤销已签业务；HOLD 本身提升 asset epoch。\n部署不解除 HOLD；Guardian 不能解除案件 HOLD。",
      "originalText": "A2 / Guardian 独立应急 nonce lane\nRiskRegistry.addHold(vault, token, false, caseId)\n即使 vault.code.length = 0 也能 HOLD；全资产范围显式 allAssets=true。\nManager.cancelOperation(operationId) 撤销已签业务；HOLD 本身提升 asset epoch。\n部署不解除 HOLD；Guardian 不能解除案件 HOLD。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-06-risk-isolation-a2",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
