      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "B1 / 本地关 gate + 追溯实际控制地址（规划）\n按 custody_movements / movement_links / 最终链事件核定 Clearing/Treasury/Cold。\n关闭结算、提现、转冷、回款、迁移的新授权；写逐作用域 incident/Outbox。\n原 Vault HOLD 不会自动冻结下游池；所有实际持有池须分别受控。",
      "originalText": "B1 / 本地关 gate + 追溯实际控制地址（规划）\n按 custody_movements / movement_links / 最终链事件核定 Clearing/Treasury/Cold。\n关闭结算、提现、转冷、回款、迁移的新授权；写逐作用域 incident/Outbox。\n原 Vault HOLD 不会自动冻结下游池；所有实际持有池须分别受控。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-06-risk-isolation-b1",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-06-risk-isolation-b2",
