    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-06-risk-isolation-b4-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1466.0,
      "y": 1156.25,
      "width": 738.0,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2666366,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "B4 / Council 明确选择继续控制或有限恢复\n继续 HOLD；或审批完整控制快照，将批准数量原子隔离到 Quarantine（07）。\n普通流出恢复须逐案 releaseHold；残余 HOLD/SECURITY_PAUSED 仍然阻断。\n解除 HOLD 不自动减少 reserve；Guardian 只能增加预留，减少需 Council/Timelock。\n已混合资产不可据 lot 标签宣称物理币已干净。",
      "originalText": "B4 / Council 明确选择继续控制或有限恢复\n继续 HOLD；或审批完整控制快照，将批准数量原子隔离到 Quarantine（07）。\n普通流出恢复须逐案 releaseHold；残余 HOLD/SECURITY_PAUSED 仍然阻断。\n解除 HOLD 不自动减少 reserve；Guardian 只能增加预留，减少需 Council/Timelock。\n已混合资产不可据 lot 标签宣称物理币已干净。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-06-risk-isolation-b4",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-06-risk-isolation-b5",
