    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-06-risk-isolation-note1-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 999.5,
      "y": 1876.25,
      "width": 441.0,
      "height": 157.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2993593,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "多案件与预留例子\n余额 1000；A reserve 100；B reserve 150；\nTreasury 安全底线 50。\n全部 HOLD 已按批准解除时，链上最多普通转出 700。\nA 的解除/隔离不能消耗 B 的 150。\n后端还需扣独立在途物理预留。\n只要还有任何 HOLD，普通出口仍阻断。",
      "originalText": "多案件与预留例子\n余额 1000；A reserve 100；B reserve 150；\nTreasury 安全底线 50。\n全部 HOLD 已按批准解除时，链上最多普通转出 700。\nA 的解除/隔离不能消耗 B 的 150。\n后端还需扣独立在途物理预留。\n只要还有任何 HOLD，普通出口仍阻断。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-06-risk-isolation-note1",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-06-risk-isolation-note2",
